flowchart LR
  subgraph PAGE[One React SPA - two presentation views]
    DASH[Desktop dashboard: CaseForm, AgentTimeline, EvidencePanel, OfferComparison]
    MOBILE[Browser phone frame: VerifiedPlan, ApprovalActions, BookingResult]
    CLIENT[One typed API client and shared selected Case ID]
    DASH --> CLIENT
    MOBILE --> CLIENT
  end
  subgraph API[FastAPI REST - same case and demo actor]
    CREATE[POST /api/cases]
    READ[GET /api/cases/id, offers, evidence, events]
    PENDING[GET /api/cases/id/approvals]
    DECIDE[POST /api/cases/id/approvals/approval_id/decision]
    ORDER[GET /api/cases/id/orders]
  end
  DB[(PostgreSQL source of truth)]
  CLIENT --> CREATE
  CLIENT --> READ
  CLIENT --> PENDING
  CLIENT --> DECIDE
  CLIENT --> ORDER
  API --> DB
  DB --> API
  NOTE[Polling GET every 1-2 seconds; refresh loads existing Case ID from URL or session selection; no frontend success fabrication]
  NOTE -.-> CLIENT
